  {"id": "vo.yasui", "lesson": "le.l09", "lesson_order": 6, "surface": "安い", "kana": "やすい", "zh": ["便宜的"], "pos": "adj_i", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj", "shop"], "examples": ["se.l09.004", "se.l09.060", "se.l11.061", "se.l12.032"], "trap_zh": "是「便宜」，和中文「安」的安全、安靜無關。", "notes": ["no.ff.yasui"]},
  {"id": "vo.atarashii", "lesson": "le.l09", "lesson_order": 7, "surface": "新しい", "kana": "あたらしい", "zh": ["新的"], "pos": "adj_i", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj"], "examples": ["se.l09.006", "se.l09.011", "se.l10.034", "se.l12.001"], "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.furui", "lesson": "le.l09", "lesson_order": 8, "surface": "古い", "kana": "ふるい", "zh": ["舊的", "老舊的"], "pos": "adj_i", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj"], "examples": ["se.l09.007", "se.l09.012", "se.l10.040", "se.l10.042"], "trap_zh": "形容物品舊；人的年紀大不用 {ja:古い|ふるい}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.ii", "lesson": "le.l09", "lesson_order": 9, "surface": "いい", "kana": "いい", "zh": ["好的"], "pos": "adj_i", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj"], "examples": ["se.l09.005", "se.l09.013", "se.l09.058", "se.l10.005"], "trap_zh": "否定和過去要用 {ja:よくない}、{ja:よかった}，不能說 {ja:いくない}、{ja:いかった}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.warui", "lesson": "le.l09", "lesson_order": 10, "surface": "悪い", "kana": "わるい", "zh": ["不好的", "壞的"], "pos": "adj_i", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj"], "examples": ["se.l09.014", "se.l09.059"], "notes": ["no.sj.aku"]},
  {"id": "vo.atsui_weather", "lesson": "le.l09", "lesson_order": 11, "surface": "暑い", "kana": "あつい", "zh": ["熱的（氣溫）"], "pos": "adj_i", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj", "nature"], "examples": ["se.l09.008", "se.l09.036", "se.l12.051", "se.l13.001"], "trap_zh": "只用於天氣或氣溫；東西燙要用 {ja:熱い|あつい}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.samui", "lesson": "le.l09", "lesson_order": 12, "surface": "寒い", "kana": "さむい", "zh": ["冷的（氣溫）"], "pos": "adj_i", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj", "nature"], "examples": ["se.l09.009", "se.l09.035", "se.l09.037", "se.l10.004"], "trap_zh": "只用於天氣或氣溫；東西冰涼要用 {ja:冷たい|つめたい}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.ooi", "lesson": "le.l09", "lesson_order": 13, "surface": "多い", "kana": "おおい", "zh": ["多的"], "pos": "adj_i", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj"], "examples": ["se.l09.010", "se.l09.055", "se.l10.048"], "trap_zh": "「人很多」說 {ja:人が多いです|ひとがおおいです}，不能直接用 {ja:多い人|おおいひと} 表示「很多人」。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.shizuka", "lesson": "le.l09", "lesson_order": 14, "surface": "静か", "kana": "しずか", "zh": ["安靜"], "pos": "adj_na", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj"], "examples": ["se.l09.024", "se.l09.025", "se.l09.034", "se.l09.042"], "notes": ["no.sj.sei_quiet"]},
  {"id": "vo.nigiyaka", "lesson": "le.l09", "lesson_order": 15, "surface": "にぎやか", "kana": "にぎやか", "zh": ["熱鬧"], "pos": "adj_na", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj"], "examples": ["se.l09.015", "se.l09.026", "se.l10.007", "se.l12.033"], "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.kirei", "lesson": "le.l09", "lesson_order": 16, "surface": "きれい", "kana": "きれい", "zh": ["漂亮", "乾淨"], "pos": "adj_na", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj"], "examples": ["se.l09.016", "se.l09.027", "se.l09.032", "se.l09.033"], "trap_zh": "雖然以 {ja:い} 結尾，卻是 {ja:な} 形容詞：{ja:きれいな町|きれいなまち}。否定是 {ja:きれいじゃありません}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.yuumei", "lesson": "le.l09", "lesson_order": 17, "surface": "有名", "kana": "ゆうめい", "zh": ["有名"], "pos": "adj_na", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj"], "same_form_zh": true, "examples": ["se.l09.017", "se.l09.039", "se.l13.018"], "notes": ["no.rd.ng_ing", "no.rd.iu"]},
  {"id": "vo.benri", "lesson": "le.l09", "lesson_order": 18, "surface": "便利", "kana": "べんり", "zh": ["方便"], "pos": "adj_na", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj"], "same_form_zh": true, "examples": ["se.l09.018", "se.l09.028", "se.l09.040", "se.l10.040"], "hook_zh": "和「便利商店」的「便利」是同一個意思。", "notes": ["no.rd.ian"]},
  {"id": "vo.genki", "lesson": "le.l09", "lesson_order": 19, "surface": "元気", "kana": "げんき", "zh": ["有精神", "健康"], "pos": "adj_na", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj", "emotion"], "same_form_zh": true, "examples": ["se.l09.019", "se.l09.029", "se.l10.006"], "trap_zh": "中文的「元氣」多指活力；{ja:元気|げんき} 也用來問候近況：{ja:お元気ですか|おげんきですか}。", "notes": ["no.ff.genki", "no.sj.ki_spirit"]},
  {"id": "vo.daijoubu", "lesson": "le.l09", "lesson_order": 20, "surface": "大丈夫", "kana": "だいじょうぶ", "zh": ["沒問題", "沒事"], "pos": "adj_na", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj"], "same_form_zh": true, "examples": ["se.l09.030", "se.l09.031"], "trap_zh": "不是中文的「大丈夫」（男子漢）。日文是「沒問題、沒事」，也能用來婉拒，表示「不用了」。", "notes": ["no.ff.daijoubu"]},
  {"id": "vo.tanoshii", "lesson": "le.l10", "lesson_order": 20, "surface": "楽しい", "kana": "たのしい", "zh": ["快樂的", "好玩的"], "pos": "adj_i", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj", "emotion"], "examples": ["se.l10.055", "se.l10.041", "se.l10.038", "se.l12.039"], "notes": ["no.sj.raku"]},
