  {"id": "vo.hayai", "lesson": "le.l17", "lesson_order": 26, "surface": "早い", "kana": "はやい", "zh": ["早的", "快（點）"], "pos": "adj_i", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj", "time"], "examples": ["se.l17.051", "se.l17.052", "se.l17.053", "se.l17.059"], "trap_zh": "時間早、催人「快一點」（{ja:早く|はやく}）都寫 {ja:早い|はやい}；速度快才寫成 {ja:速い|はやい}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.hayai_fast", "lesson": "le.l17", "lesson_order": 27, "surface": "速い", "kana": "はやい", "zh": ["快的（速度）"], "pos": "adj_i", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj"], "examples": ["se.l17.056", "se.l17.057"], "trap_zh": "速度快用 {ja:速い|はやい}；時間早寫成 {ja:早い|はやい}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.osoi", "lesson": "le.l17", "lesson_order": 28, "surface": "遅い", "kana": "おそい", "zh": ["慢的", "晚的"], "pos": "adj_i", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj", "time"], "examples": ["se.l17.054", "se.l17.055", "se.l19.020"], "trap_zh": "時間晚、速度慢都用這個字。", "notes": ["no.sj.chi"]},
  {"id": "vo.shinsetsu", "lesson": "le.l17", "lesson_order": 29, "surface": "親切", "kana": "しんせつ", "zh": ["親切", "好心"], "pos": "adj_na", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n4", "topics": ["adj", "emotion"], "same_form_zh": true, "examples": ["se.l17.047", "se.l19.051"], "trap_zh": "重點在「主動幫人、待人好」，比中文的「親切」更偏向實際的善意。", "notes": ["no.ff.shinsetsu"]},
  {"id": "vo.muri", "lesson": "le.l18", "lesson_order": 23, "surface": "無理", "kana": "むり", "zh": ["辦不到", "勉強（硬撐）"], "pos": "adj_na", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n4", "topics": ["adj", "emotion"], "same_form_zh": true, "examples": ["se.l18.023", "se.l18.024"], "trap_zh": "不是中文的「無理取鬧」。{ja:無理|むり} 是「辦不到、勉強」。", "notes": ["no.ff.muri"]},
  {"id": "vo.abunai", "lesson": "le.l18", "lesson_order": 25, "surface": "危ない", "kana": "あぶない", "zh": ["危險的"], "pos": "adj_i", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj"], "examples": ["se.l18.026", "se.l19.014"], "trap_zh": "也常用來喊人「小心！」。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.sugoi", "lesson": "le.l21", "lesson_order": 20, "surface": "すごい", "kana": "すごい", "zh": ["厲害的", "驚人的"], "pos": "adj_i", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n4", "topics": ["adj"], "examples": ["se.l21.007", "se.l21.029", "se.l22.052", "se.l23.043"], "trap_zh": "修飾形容詞時用 {ja:すごく}；朋友間也有人直接說 {ja:すごいおいしい}，但不算標準。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.dame", "lesson": "le.l21", "lesson_order": 22, "surface": "だめ", "kana": "だめ", "zh": ["不行", "沒用"], "pos": "adj_na", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n4", "topics": ["adj"], "examples": ["se.l21.031", "se.l21.032", "se.l24.058", "se.l24.066"], "trap_zh": "直接拒絕或制止時用，語氣較強，對長輩要委婉一點。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.kawaii", "lesson": "le.l21", "lesson_order": 24, "surface": "かわいい", "kana": "かわいい", "zh": ["可愛的"], "pos": "adj_i", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adj"], "examples": ["se.l21.021", "se.l21.027", "se.l23.048"], "hook_zh": "台灣常說的「卡哇伊」就是這個字。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.kakkoii", "lesson": "le.l21", "lesson_order": 25, "surface": "かっこいい", "kana": "かっこいい", "zh": ["帥的", "好看的"], "pos": "adj_i", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["adj"], "examples": ["se.l21.034", "se.l22.022", "se.l24.032"], "trap_zh": "活用和 {ja:いい} 一樣：否定是 {ja:かっこよくない}，過去是 {ja:かっこよかった}。", "notes": []},
